# Roborazzi writes actual/diff images next to the goldens; only goldens are tracked.
**/src/test/screenshots/*_actual.png
**/src/test/screenshots/*_compare.png

# The installed skills live in .agents/skills and are tracked there. `.claude/skills`
# holds *absolute* symlinks into them ("/j/projects/..."), which are true only on the
# machine that ran the installer -- committing them would either break on any other
# clone or, on a platform without symlink support, commit a second copy of every
# skill file. The lock file plus .agents/ is what a fresh clone needs.
.claude/
